* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_cmp4: double-tail dynamic comparator, revision 3. Topology of r1_cmp2 (revision 2); integration
* capacitors 32u/4u (PMOS gate capacitors on dip/din). clk=1, clkb=0: evaluate; clk=0: reset.
* inp > inn -> outp stays high.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_cmp4_s1 inp inn dip din clkb vbp vdd gnd wi=48u li=0.3u ngi=12 wt=16u wtc=16u ltc=0.5u
XMT1 tail0 clkb vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wt} l=0.13u ng=4 m=1
XMTC tail  vbp  tail0 vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wtc} l={ltc} ng=2 m=1
XM1  dip  inp  tail vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wi} l={li} ng={ngi} m=1
XM2  din  inn  tail vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wi} l={li} ng={ngi} m=1
.ends r1_cmp4_s1

.subckt r1_cmp4 inp inn clk clkb outp outn vbp vdd gnd wi=48u li=0.3u ngi=12 wt=16u wtc=16u ltc=0.5u wcap=80u lcap=4u wr=20u wh=8u
XS1  inp inn dip din clkb vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp4_s1 wi={wi} li={li} ngi={ngi} wt={wt} wtc={wtc} ltc={ltc}
XCI1 vdd  dip  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wcap} l={lcap} ng=4 m=1
XCI2 vdd  din  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wcap} l={lcap} ng=4 m=1
XMR1 dip  clkb gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wr} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMR2 din  clkb gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wr} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMT2 lt   clk  gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMN1 outp outn lt   gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMN2 outn outp lt   gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMP1 outp outn vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMP2 outn outp vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMH1 outp dip  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wh} l=0.13u ng=2 m=1
XMH2 outn din  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wh} l=0.13u ng=2 m=1
XBP1 outpb outp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XBN1 outpb outp gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XBP2 outnb outn vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XBN2 outnb outn gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
Cbp outpb gnd 3f
Cbn outnb gnd 3f
.ends r1_cmp4

* r1_cmp4_bias: tail bias, I = (VDD - Vsg(XMBD)) / R with R = rppd 1u x 160u (about 42 kohm at
* 260 ohm/sq + heads). Diode XMBD w = wtc / 20. The current falls where VDD - |Vtp| falls (low VDD, slow
* PMOS), which keeps the integration time C_int (VDD - |Vtp|) / I nearly constant.
.subckt r1_cmp4_bias vbp vdd gnd rbw=1u rbl=160u
XMBD vbp vbp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=0.8u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XRB  vbp gnd gnd rppd w={rbw} l={rbl} m=1
.ends r1_cmp4_bias

* r1_cmp4_ibias: the revision-2 ideal-current bias, kept for comparison runs only.
.subckt r1_cmp4_ibias vbp vdd gnd ib=14u
Ibc vbp gnd {ib}
XMBD vbp vbp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=0.8u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
.ends r1_cmp4_ibias

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_cmp5n: NMOS-input double-tail dynamic comparator (revision 5, decision 0 at CM 0.6 V). The r1_cmp4
* topology mirrored: clk=1 (clkb=0) evaluate, the NMOS pair discharges the integration nodes dip/din from VDD
* (integration capacitors: NMOS gate capacitors 30u/4u); clk=0 reset (PMOS precharge to VDD, outputs
* held low by XMH1/2). inp > inn -> dip falls first -> XMH1 releases outp first -> outp goes high.
* Reset state of the outputs: low (r1_cmp4: high).
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_cmp5n_s1 inp inn dip din clk vbn vdd gnd wi=16u li=0.5u ngi=4 wt=8u wtc=4u ltc=0.5u
XMT1 tail0 clk gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wt} l=0.13u ng=2 m=1
XMTC tail  vbn tail0 gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wtc} l={ltc} ng=1 m=1
XM1  dip  inp  tail gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wi} l={li} ng={ngi} m=1
XM2  din  inn  tail gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wi} l={li} ng={ngi} m=1
.ends r1_cmp5n_s1

.subckt r1_cmp5n inp inn clk clkb outp outn vbn vdd gnd wi=16u li=0.5u ngi=4 wt=8u wtc=4u ltc=0.5u wcap=30u lcap=4u wr=16u wh=8u wlp=4u wlt=8u
XS1  inp inn dip din clk vbn vdd gnd r1_cmp5n_s1 wi={wi} li={li} ngi={ngi} wt={wt} wtc={wtc} ltc={ltc}
XCI1 gnd  dip  gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wcap} l={lcap} ng=2 m=1
XCI2 gnd  din  gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wcap} l={lcap} ng=2 m=1
XMR1 dip  clk  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wr} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMR2 din  clk  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wr} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMT2 lt   clkb vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wlt} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMP1 outp outn lt   vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wlp} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMP2 outn outp lt   vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wlp} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMN1 outp outn gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMN2 outn outp gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMH1 outp dip  gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wh} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMH2 outn din  gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wh} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XBP1 outpb outp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XBN1 outpb outp gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XBP2 outnb outn vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XBN2 outnb outn gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
Cbp outpb gnd 3f
Cbn outnb gnd 3f
.ends r1_cmp5n

* r1_cmp5n_bias: tail bias of r1_cmp5n, I = (VDD - Vgs(XMBD)) / R, R = rppd 1u x 160u from VDD (mirror of
* r1_cmp4_bias). Diode XMBD w = wtc / 20.
.subckt r1_cmp5n_bias vbn vdd gnd rbw=1u rbl=160u
XMBD vbn vbn gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.2u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XRB  vdd vbn gnd rppd w={rbw} l={rbl} m=1
.ends r1_cmp5n_bias

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_cmp4_clkgen: comparator clock from clk30 (revision 4). mclk = NAND(clk30, x), x = clk30 inverted and
* delayed by 5 inverters (wn 0.5u/0.5u, wp 1u/0.5u, 10f load each). A rising clk30 edge gives mclk = 0 (comparator
* reset) for the chain delay; then mclk = 1 (evaluate) until the next rising edge. mclkb = NOT mclk.
* clk30 low half: x = 1 after the falling edge -> NAND output = 1 (evaluate continues). Width: README.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_cmp4_clkgen clk30 mclk mclkb vdd gnd
XPD0 d0 clk30 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND0 d0 clk30 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD0 d0 gnd 10f
XPD1 d1 d0 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND1 d1 d0 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD1 d1 gnd 10f
XPD2 d2 d1 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND2 d2 d1 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD2 d2 gnd 10f
XPD3 d3 d2 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND3 d3 d2 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD3 d3 gnd 10f
XPD4 x d3 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND4 x d3 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD4 x gnd 10f
XPA mclk clk30 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPB mclk x vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNA mclk clk30 nn gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNB nn x gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPI mclkb mclk vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNI mclkb mclk gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
.ends r1_cmp4_clkgen

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_th4: one revision-4 track-and-hold slice (CDAC P and N, top-plate sampling, 13 caps per side).
* in0 sampled while trk0=1, in1 while trk1=1 (never both); sample on the falling edge. lsb nodes reset
* to VREF while either path tracks. cpK/cnK = 1: bottom plate K of side P/N goes VREF -> GND.
* Full variant: both input pairs with complete bootstrapped switches; transistor drivers r1_drv.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_th4 in0p in0n in1p in1n trk0 trk1 top_p top_n cp12 cp11 cp10 cp9 cp8 cp7 cp6 cp5 cp4 cp3 cp2 cp1 cp0 cn12 cn11 cn10 cn9 cn8 cn7 cn6 cn5 cn4 cn3 cn2 cn1 cn0 vdd vref vrefl gnd
XPT0a t0b trk0 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNT0a t0b trk0 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPT0b t0 t0b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNT0b t0 t0b gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPT1a t1b trk1 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNT1a t1b trk1 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPT1b t1 t1b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNT1b t1 t1b gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XS0P in0p top_p t0 t0b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS0N in0n top_n t0 t0b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS1P in1p top_p t1 t1b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS1N in1n top_n t1 t1b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XPR1 rstb_n t0b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPR2 rstb_n t1b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNR1 rstb_n t0b nr gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNR2 nr t1b gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPR3 rstb rstb_n vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNR3 rstb rstb_n gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XLRP lsb_p rstb vrefl vrefl sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XLRN lsb_n rstb vrefl vrefl sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XDACP top_p lsb_p bp12 bp11 bp10 bp9 bp8 bp7 bp6 bp5 bp4 bp3 bp2 bp1 bp0 r1_cdac3_side
XDACN top_n lsb_n bn12 bn11 bn10 bn9 bn8 bn7 bn6 bn5 bn4 bn3 bn2 bn1 bn0 r1_cdac3_side
XDp12 cp12 bp12 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
XDp11 cp11 bp11 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
XDp10 cp10 bp10 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
XDp9 cp9 bp9 vref gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp8 cp8 bp8 vref gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp7 cp7 bp7 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp6 cp6 bp6 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp5 cp5 bp5 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp4 cp4 bp4 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp3 cp3 bp3 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp2 cp2 bp2 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp1 cp1 bp1 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDp0 cp0 bp0 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn12 cn12 bn12 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
XDn11 cn11 bn11 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
XDn10 cn10 bn10 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
XDn9 cn9 bn9 vref gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn8 cn8 bn8 vref gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn7 cn7 bn7 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn6 cn6 bn6 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn5 cn5 bn5 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn4 cn4 bn4 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn3 cn3 bn3 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn2 cn2 bn2 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn1 cn1 bn1 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
XDn0 cn0 bn0 vrefl gnd r1_drv wp=1u wn=0.5u
* revision 4: LSB-array drivers C7..C0 and the lsb-node reset on vrefl
.ends r1_th4

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_th4_fast: one revision-4 track-and-hold slice (CDAC P and N, top-plate sampling, 13 caps per side).
* in0 sampled while trk0=1, in1 while trk1=1 (never both); sample on the falling edge. lsb nodes reset
* to VREF while either path tracks. cpK/cnK = 1: bottom plate K of side P/N goes VREF -> GND.
* Fast variant: in1 pair reduced to r1_offsw, trk1 unused; drivers r1_drv_sw (ideal 400 ohm).
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_th4_fast in0p in0n in1p in1n trk0 trk1 top_p top_n cp12 cp11 cp10 cp9 cp8 cp7 cp6 cp5 cp4 cp3 cp2 cp1 cp0 cn12 cn11 cn10 cn9 cn8 cn7 cn6 cn5 cn4 cn3 cn2 cn1 cn0 vdd vref vrefl gnd
XPT0a t0b trk0 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNT0a t0b trk0 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPT0b t0 t0b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNT0b t0 t0b gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XS0P in0p top_p t0 t0b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS0N in0n top_n t0 t0b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS1P in1p top_p gnd r1_offsw
XS1N in1n top_n gnd r1_offsw
Rtrk1 trk1 gnd 1e9
XLRP lsb_p t0b vrefl vrefl sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XLRN lsb_n t0b vrefl vrefl sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XDACP top_p lsb_p bp12 bp11 bp10 bp9 bp8 bp7 bp6 bp5 bp4 bp3 bp2 bp1 bp0 r1_cdac3_side
XDACN top_n lsb_n bn12 bn11 bn10 bn9 bn8 bn7 bn6 bn5 bn4 bn3 bn2 bn1 bn0 r1_cdac3_side
XDp12 cp12 bp12 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp11 cp11 bp11 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp10 cp10 bp10 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp9 cp9 bp9 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp8 cp8 bp8 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp7 cp7 bp7 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp6 cp6 bp6 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp5 cp5 bp5 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp4 cp4 bp4 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp3 cp3 bp3 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp2 cp2 bp2 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp1 cp1 bp1 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDp0 cp0 bp0 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
XDn12 cn12 bn12 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDn11 cn11 bn11 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDn10 cn10 bn10 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDn9 cn9 bn9 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDn8 cn8 bn8 vref gnd r1_drv_sw
XDn7 cn7 bn7 vrefl gnd r1_drv_sw
