* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_adc5_core: R1 ADC revision-5 core. Slice A: in0 = SIN, in1 = ISA. Slice B: in0 = COS, in1 = ISB.
* Both slices convert in parallel (D18), one decision per clk30 tick. Decision 0: NMOS-input r1_cmp5n;
* decisions 1..13: PMOS-input r1_cmp4. Per-slice reference ports: vrefX (C12..C8 and C7..C0 drivers of the
* revision-4 split: MSB array) and vreflX (LSB array C7..C0 and lsb-node reset). Tie for one reference.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_adc5_core sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 clk30 wina winb lata latb stba0 stba1 stba2 stba3 stba4 stba5 stba6 stba7 stba8 stba9 stba10 stba11 stba12 stba13 stbb0 stbb1 stbb2 stbb3 stbb4 stbb5 stbb6 stbb7 stbb8 stbb9 stbb10 stbb11 stbb12 stbb13 rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vrefa vrefb vrefla vreflb gnd
XCKG clk30 mclk mclkb vdd gnd r1_cmp4_clkgen
XTHA sinp sinn isap isan trka0 trka1 topap topan cpa12 cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna12 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 vdd vrefa vrefla gnd r1_th4
XCBIAS vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp4_bias
XCBIASN vbn vdd gnd r1_cmp5n_bias
XCMPA topap topan clka clkab oap oan vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp4
XCMPNA topap topan clkna clknab oanp oann vbn vdd gnd r1_cmp5n
XTHB cosp cosn isbp isbn trkb0 trkb1 topbp topbn cpb12 cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb12 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 vdd vrefb vreflb gnd r1_th4
XCMPB topbp topbn clkb clkbb obp obn vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp4
XCMPNB topbp topbn clknb clknbb obnp obnn vbn vdd gnd r1_cmp5n
XSAR oap oan obp obn oanp obnp mclk wina winb trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 lata latb stba0 stba1 stba2 stba3 stba4 stba5 stba6 stba7 stba8 stba9 stba10 stba11 stba12 stba13 stbb0 stbb1 stbb2 stbb3 stbb4 stbb5 stbb6 stbb7 stbb8 stbb9 stbb10 stbb11 stbb12 stbb13 clka clkab clkb clkbb clkna clknab clknb clknbb cpa12 cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna12 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 cpb12 cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb12 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 rawa rawb vdd gnd r1_sar5_logic
.ends r1_adc5_core

