* r1_refbuf5h: revision-4 r1_refbuf4h (r1_refbuf4 without the input divider; error-amplifier gate on vbg,
* vref = vbg). Accepted baseline (coordinator 2026-10-21). Same devices as r1_refbuf4 otherwise.
.subckt r1_refbuf5h vbg vref vdda gnd msf=32 mib=160 ndec=6 ncg=1 mt=1 lt=8u
Ibias vdda nb 5u
XMB0 nb nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMT  ntl nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l={lt} ng=1 m={mt}
XM1  na  vbg ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1
XM2  ng  vref ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1
XM3  na  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XM4  ng  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XCG  ng  gnd cap_cmim w=50u l=50u m={ncg}
XMSF vdda ng vref gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.45u ng=4 m={msf}
XMIB vref nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m={mib}
XCD  vref gnd cap_cmim w=70u l=70u m={ndec}
.ends r1_refbuf5h


* r1_refbuf5 (R2-4 option 3): r1_refbuf5h with a separate LSB-array reference vrefl from the same buffer.
* The LSB array (C7..C0, lsb-node reset) draws its switching charge from vrefl and its own decoupling;
* the main follower and the error amplifier see only the MSB array (C12..C8).
* Pin nb (T2 2026-10-21): bias current input (r1_bias ib_adc_ref, 5.07 uA at tt) into the diode XMB0.
.subckt r1_refbuf5 vbg vref vrefl nb vdda gnd msf=32 mib=160 ndec=6 ncg=1 mt=1 lt=8u msfl=8 mibl=40 ndecl=1
* nb: bias input, current sourced into the diode XMB0 by r1_bias (ib_adc_ref)
XMB0 nb nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMT  ntl nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l={lt} ng=1 m={mt}
XM1  na  vbg ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1
XM2  ng  vref ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1
XM3  na  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XM4  ng  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XCG  ng  gnd cap_cmim w=50u l=50u m={ncg}
XMSF vdda ng vref gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.45u ng=4 m={msf}
XMIB vref nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m={mib}
XCD  vref gnd cap_cmim w=70u l=70u m={ndec}
* option 3: LSB-array sub-reference, a second source follower on the same gate node ng (no second
* loop: vrefl = ng - Vgs at the same current density as the main follower, msfl/mibl = msf/mib)
XMSFL vdda ng vrefl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.45u ng=4 m={msfl}
XMIBL vrefl nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m={mibl}
XCDL vrefl gnd cap_cmim w=70u l=70u m={ndecl}
.ends r1_refbuf5


* r1_refps5 (R2-4 option 2): per-slice decoupling capacitor. PMOS switch from the buffer output vin to the slice
* reference vout, closed while the slice tracks (trk0 OR trk1), open during its conversion; Cres = nres MIM
* cells of 70 x 70 um (7.36 pF each) on vout. Gate = NOR(trk0, trk1) (1.2 V domain).
.subckt r1_refps5 vin vout trk0 trk1 vdd gnd wsw=40u nres=3
XNP1 nx trk0 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNP2 g trk1 nx vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNN1 g trk0 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNN2 g trk1 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XSW vout g vin vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wsw} l=0.13u ng=8 m=1
XCR vout gnd cap_cmim w=70u l=70u m={nres}
.ends r1_refps5

* r1_reffilt5: reference input filter, MIM w x w from vbg to ground (with the r1_bgr source resistance).
.subckt r1_reffilt5 vbg gnd w=82u
XCF vbg gnd cap_cmim w={w} l={w} m=1
.ends r1_reffilt5

* =============================================================================================
* Revision 6 cells (PLAN.md D28, T2o 2026-10-28)
* =============================================================================================
* r1_cmp6_clkgen: r1_cmp4_clkgen with the delay-chain input on gnd (x = 1): mclk = NOT clk30. Reset (mclk = 0)
* from the rising clk30 edge to the falling edge, evaluate from the falling edge to the next rising edge.
.subckt r1_cmp6_clkgen clk30 mclk mclkb vdd gnd
XPD0 d0 gnd vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND0 d0 gnd gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD0 d0 gnd 10f
XPD1 d1 d0 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND1 d1 d0 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD1 d1 gnd 10f
XPD2 d2 d1 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND2 d2 d1 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD2 d2 gnd 10f
XPD3 d3 d2 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND3 d3 d2 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD3 d3 gnd 10f
XPD4 x d3 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
XND4 x d3 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1
CD4 x gnd 10f
XPA mclk clk30 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPB mclk x vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNA mclk clk30 nn gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNB nn x gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XPI mclkb mclk vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XNI mclkb mclk gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
.ends r1_cmp6_clkgen

* r1_refbuf6: r1_refbuf5 with msfl 24 / mibl 120 (LSB-array follower and sink x3, same density; vrefl branch
* 600 uA at 5 uA bias). Same pins as r1_refbuf5. Layout: ndec 4, ndecl 2 as for r1_refbuf5.
.subckt r1_refbuf6 vbg vref vrefl nb vdda gnd msf=32 mib=160 ndec=6 ncg=1 mt=1 lt=8u msfl=24 mibl=120 ndecl=1
* nb: bias input, current sourced into the diode XMB0 by r1_bias (ib_adc_ref)
XMB0 nb nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XMT  ntl nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l={lt} ng=1 m={mt}
XM1  na  vbg ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1
XM2  ng  vref ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1
XM3  na  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XM4  ng  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1
XCG  ng  gnd cap_cmim w=50u l=50u m={ncg}
XMSF vdda ng vref gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.45u ng=4 m={msf}
XMIB vref nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m={mib}
XCD  vref gnd cap_cmim w=70u l=70u m={ndec}
* option 3: LSB-array sub-reference, a second source follower on the same gate node ng (no second
* loop: vrefl = ng - Vgs at the same current density as the main follower, msfl/mibl = msf/mib)
XMSFL vdda ng vrefl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.45u ng=4 m={msfl}
XMIBL vrefl nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m={mibl}
XCDL vrefl gnd cap_cmim w=70u l=70u m={ndecl}
.ends r1_refbuf6

* r1_adc6_core*: the revision-5 cores with r1_cmp6_clkgen (falling-edge strobe).
.subckt r1_adc6_core sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 clk30 wina winb lata latb stba0 stba1 stba2 stba3 stba4 stba5 stba6 stba7 stba8 stba9 stba10 stba11 stba12 stba13 stbb0 stbb1 stbb2 stbb3 stbb4 stbb5 stbb6 stbb7 stbb8 stbb9 stbb10 stbb11 stbb12 stbb13 rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vrefa vrefb vrefla vreflb gnd
XCKG clk30 mclk mclkb vdd gnd r1_cmp6_clkgen
XTHA sinp sinn isap isan trka0 trka1 topap topan cpa12 cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna12 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 vdd vrefa vrefla gnd r1_th4
XCBIAS vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp4_bias
XCBIASN vbn vdd gnd r1_cmp5n_bias
XCMPA topap topan clka clkab oap oan vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp4
XCMPNA topap topan clkna clknab oanp oann vbn vdd gnd r1_cmp5n
XTHB cosp cosn isbp isbn trkb0 trkb1 topbp topbn cpb12 cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb12 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 vdd vrefb vreflb gnd r1_th4
XCMPB topbp topbn clkb clkbb obp obn vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp4
XCMPNB topbp topbn clknb clknbb obnp obnn vbn vdd gnd r1_cmp5n
XSAR oap oan obp obn oanp obnp mclk wina winb trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 lata latb stba0 stba1 stba2 stba3 stba4 stba5 stba6 stba7 stba8 stba9 stba10 stba11 stba12 stba13 stbb0 stbb1 stbb2 stbb3 stbb4 stbb5 stbb6 stbb7 stbb8 stbb9 stbb10 stbb11 stbb12 stbb13 clka clkab clkb clkbb clkna clknab clknb clknbb cpa12 cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna12 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 cpb12 cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb12 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 rawa rawb vdd gnd r1_sar5_logic
.ends r1_adc6_core

